<title>ARGENTINA: Duff &amp; Phelps rates Argentina's $2 bln bond &quot;BB&quot;.</title>
<headline>Duff &amp; Phelps rates Argentina's $2 bln bond &quot;BB&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff and Phelps Credit Rating Co said Monday it was assigning a &quot;BB&quot; rating to Argentina's upcoming $2.0 billion bond issue.</p>
<p>&quot;DCR's &quot;BB&quot; (Double-B) rating for the Republic of Argentina's long-term foreign currency obligations reflects the country's proven commitment to economic reforms,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
</text>
